=======================================================

This file enumerates the copyright holders and licenses of all software
that ends up in an installed copy of this R package. Only the first
component below (the R package itself) is distributed in this package's
CRAN source tarball. Every other component listed here is downloaded
from its own upstream project, verified against a pinned checksum,
compiled from source, and staged into this package's installed tree by
this package's `configure` script at install time (see `configure` and
`tools/versions.sh` for the exact pinned versions, source URLs and
checksums). None of that upstream source code is redistributed inside
the CRAN source tarball itself.

